* Files in this folder are Merlin16 subroutine library files.
* They should be copied to your Merlin16 subroutine library folder.
* To find the location of your Merlin16 subroutine library folder
* enter Merlin and catalog pathname "5/"
* On my system 5/ is /Bernie/Merlin16/Subrout.Lib
* The Casper link file relies on the library folder being assigned to 5/
* If you have modified Merlins default paths then you will need
* to modify the Casper link file. Please do not commit your changes into CVS.

